Small Organization Commercial Grant:

If you are an individual or an organization with fewer than 10 total employees
and contractors, counted across your company, parent companies, subsidiaries,
and other controlled affiliates, you may use the materials in this repository
in proprietary or closed-source applications and services without a separate
written commercial license, subject to the restrictions below.

This grant ends when you no longer qualify as a small organization. You may
continue using and distributing existing SwiftPython-based applications for up
to 90 days after crossing the threshold solely to transition to a written
commercial license or another valid licensing path.

This grant does not permit selling, sublicensing, hosting, or redistributing
SwiftPython itself as a standalone runtime, SDK, developer tool, hosted bridge,
or substantially similar competing product.

Permission is granted to users operating under any valid licensing path to
use the materials in this repository, including:

1. downloading and pinning this package with Swift Package Manager;
2. linking applications against SwiftPythonRuntime.xcframework;
3. bundling SwiftPythonWorker with covered applications;
4. deploying the VMWorker scripts with covered applications or tenant images;
5. copying and adapting the entitlement templates for covered applications;
6. using the public documentation as integration guidance.

